OL,3,GNEWSALincoln Castle's new dragon has
OL,4,Aits first visitors
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new dragon has spread his wings at
OL,7,FLincoln Castle and is keeping a
OL,8,Fwatchful eye over the grounds ` and the
OL,9,Ffamilies flocking to see him.
OL,11,FHastings, a large scaly sculpture
OL,12,Fsituated on top of the Heritage Skills
OL,13,FCentre, is the third dragon to have
OL,14,Ftaken up residence at the castle.
OL,16,FHe was inspired by the mythical beasts
OL,17,Fpictured in the Bayeux Tapestry, and
OL,18,Ftakes his name from the Battle of
OL,19,FHastings.
